IMPORTANT RESEARCH DISCLAIMER
------------------------------
FusionDx is a research and educational demonstration. It has NOT been validated
as a clinical diagnostic system and must NOT be used for any clinical, medical,
or diagnostic decision-making. All findings are exploratory.

Data used in this project comes from the TCGA-BRCA dataset via the NIH Genomic
Data Commons (https://portal.gdc.cancer.gov/), which is made available under
GDC's open-access data tier. Users of this software are responsible for
complying with GDC's data use policies.
